# Bundled squad files live here.
#
# This directory is populated by scripts/sync_squad.py at build time (hatchling
# custom build hook configured in pyproject.toml). The hook copies relevant
# files from squads/architettura-progetto/ (sibling of cli/) into:
#
#   archprime_cli/squad/agents/      — 17 agent .md files
#   archprime_cli/squad/tasks/       — 6 task .md files
#   archprime_cli/squad/workflows/   — dal-brief-al-cantiere.yaml
#   archprime_cli/squad/checklists/  — 5 QA checklist files
#   archprime_cli/squad/templates/   — 4 template files
#   archprime_cli/squad/data/        — rules + prezzario + samples
#   archprime_cli/squad/config.yaml  — squad config
#   archprime_cli/squad/README.md    — squad readme
#
# DO NOT edit files here directly — edit them in squads/architettura-progetto/
# (the source of truth) and rebuild.
#
# This .gitkeep file ensures the directory exists in the repo even when empty
# (the rest of squad/ is gitignored — see ../../.gitignore).
